cope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"88702","synopsis":"猿楽本社に連行された番場は、極秘任務に同行させられる。同社の兵器化実験の失敗で奇獣が氾濫した町に潜入、研究チームの甲斐博士を救出しようとするが、奇獣の群れに取り囲まれてしまう…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5kng4GNt1hQKxJZco6T5QyjFvrk.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"88703","synopsis":"突然鳴り響いた謎の音に、番場は身動きを封じられてしまう。苦しむ番場、その姿をあざ笑うかのように一人の少女現れる。一方、木村は一連の騒動の背後で蠢く思惑に気がつき、回避しようとするが…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wh1CAw4zDaZrj7cDewf4VU3plKm.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88704","synopsis":"番場を襲った事件の真相が明らかになる。それは木村も知り得ない新たな奇獣計画の一部だった。そんな中さらなる奇獣事件が発生。猿楽研究員・秋良とその娘・莉央が襲われてしまう…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4c7oTbTVa1ZU0tGIQQoDdwYn2s5.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"88705","synopsis":"霧子は、猿楽の研究所より脱走したある貴重な奇獣を追っていた。その奇獣は番場宗介と同じく、人間の知性を残したまま、影鰐の能力を備えているという。 ついに発見し確保したのだが…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/whG4ROV5RzPXSHWoOn4kZLtuPXL.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"88706","synopsis":"番場宗介は、猿楽製薬に囚われていた。検体として投薬を繰り返される中、謎の夢を見る。それは影鰐に関わるある記憶だった。番場は、影鰐を生み出した者、影鰐に喰われた者、そして一人生き残った者を目撃する！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2va6tXm2wjstR2HfIzwXmO1APMz.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"88707","synopsis":"番場は、本間局長率いるチームの研究施設に運び込まれていた。そこで行われるのは、奇獣や番場を利用した新たな生物兵器の生成、そしてビジネス――。本間に体の自由を奪われ、兵器生成の検体に組み込まれる番場。脱出不可能の危機が迫る…!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2kQ87JDpHLYOxikvUBqfqZYKeaM.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"88708","synopsis":"木村の協力により猿楽研究施設を抜け出した番場は影鰐を追う。その頃、ナギは奇獣の気配を辿り、ある廃墟の町に辿り着いた。一人の少女と一夜をともにすることになったのだが…。奇獣と母を失った記憶、二つの悪夢がナギに襲いかかる…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uKaTUwPFoxeDMEbV7KCJ1zWzoS.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"88709","synopsis":"番場と木村は雲南省の廃村にたどり着く。そこはかつて蟲毒の儀式が行われ、影鰐が潜む忌まわしき場所。意を決する番場の前に、鋭く突き刺さる槍、いつの間にか忍び寄る影鰐。ついに死闘の幕があける…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v5A9cjm6RQoXiIyaQ1eQobkQhtn.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21636","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32682","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"88710","synopsis":"追い詰められた影鰐の力は悍ましいほど強大だった。だが番場の目は生きていた。クローンを解放し、身を奇獣化させながら、最後の闘いに挑む番場。脈々と続く負の連鎖、そして復讐、番場は影鰐と人間の因縁を断ち切ることはできるのか…!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jrmROIMU7sEu6ypeyYFI463dqV3.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11921","sc